    body: "Th\u1EF1c h\xE0nh t\u1EF1 do \xB7 Chu\u1EA9n \u0111\u1ED9 \xB7 Nh\u1EADn bi\u1EBFt ch\u1EA5t \xB7 L\u1EAFp r\xE1p d\u1EE5ng c\u1EE5\n720 h\xF3a ch\u1EA5t \xB7 Robot tr\u1EE3 l\xFD AI \xB7 M\xE1y ph\xE2n t\xEDch hi\u1EC7n \u0111\u1EA1i"
    image: {fileID: 0}
    live: 0
  - title: "B\xC0I H\u1ECCC H\xD4M NAY: CHU\u1EA8N \u0110\u1ED8 AXIT - BAZ\u01A0"
    body: "X\xE1c \u0111\u1ECBnh n\u1ED3ng \u0111\u1ED9 HCl b\u1EB1ng dung d\u1ECBch NaOH 0,1 M\n1. Tr\xE1ng v\xE0 n\u1EA1p buret NaOH, \u0111\u1ECDc th\u1EC3 t\xEDch \u0111\u1EA7u\n2. H\xFAt 25,00 ml HCl v\xE0o b\xECnh n\xF3n, th\xEAm phenolphtalein\n3. Nh\u1ECF NaOH, l\u1EAFc \u0111\u1EC1u t\u1EDBi khi h\u1ED3ng nh\u1EA1t b\u1EC1n 30 gi\xE2y\n4. \u0110\u1ECDc th\u1EC3 t\xEDch cu\u1ED1i, l\xE0m 3 l\u1EA7n, l\u1EA5y trung b\xECnh"
    image: {fileID: 0}
    live: 0
